WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,800
Water entered the ground floor

2
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,240
Residents who are temporarily uninhabitable

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,440
Please prepare necessary luggage

4
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:15,650
The rescue team will be transferred to temporary resettlement sites in batches

5
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,850
Please cooperate with the on-site registration rescue team.

6
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,050
People living in the corridor can leave

7
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:22,690
It is said that the affected residents on the ground floor are given priority.

8
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:27,250
Each person can only carry necessary luggage

9
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,290
Leave other things first

10
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,650
These are all things from our home

11
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:30,850
Why don't you let me take it?

12
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:32,810
Too much luggage will affect the safety of rescue operations

13
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,050
If you are temporarily unwilling to transfer

14
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:35,050
You can also stay here

15
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:40,400
It won't happen if you go out

16
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,520
You have to make the decision for me

17
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,720
We are now responsible for transferring other disputes

18
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,720
Wait for the environment to stabilize before handling it through corresponding channels.
